    "body": "<h1>Error reference {{ds:component/chip|label=v2 / v3|variant=primary}} {{ds:component/chip|label=Stable|variant=success}}</h1>

<p>Every non-2xx response from the Godzilla REST API returns a consistent JSON error envelope containing a machine-readable error code and human-readable message.</p>

<h2 id="errors">Error shape</h2>
{{ds:component/code-block|filename=error-response.json|language=json|code={
  "error": {
    "code": "connector_unauthorized",
    "message": "The connector's credentials were rejected by the source system.",
