  }
}}}

{{ds:component/alert|variant=danger|title=Breaking change from v1|body_html=<p>v1 returned bare error strings. Current API versions always wrap errors in an <code>error</code> object with a stable <code>code</code> field — match on <code>code</code>, not on <code>message</code> text.</p>}}

